  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Svensk-afrikanska museeprogrammet &#xE4;r ett n&#xE4;tverk mellan svenska l&#xE4;ns- museer och afrikanska museer. Totalt &#xE4;r 20-25 museer inblandade. De arbetar tillsammans med utbyte av kunskap, erfarenheter och in- formation.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Swedish African museum program is a network between Swedish and African Museums. 20-25 museums are involved , a Swedish museum has a twinning museum in Africa. Between the museums and within the net- work there are exchange of experiences and information.</narrative>
  </description>
